# Western Plaguelands - Recipes companion (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# Only recipes, patterns, plans, schematics and formulae whose SOURCE is physically
# in the Western Plaguelands, verified against the local Forever game data
# (questie-forever item drop tables). No recipe vendor spawns in the zone - all
# sixteen ship as drop collects off narrow in-zone droppers. Every other
# in-zone-dropping recipe is a generic multi-zone world drop, and quest records
# carry no reward data (see docs/companion-unverified.md). Trainer-taught staples
# are excluded: Polestar's own profession guides cover those. Each step is gated
# to its profession; other characters skip it cleanly. First Aid and Fishing have
# no Western Plaguelands source, so that is stated, not padded.
guide butler-routes-completionist/western-plaguelands-recipes
title Western Plaguelands - Recipes
levels 50-58
zone Western Plaguelands
faction Alliance
category Professions
folder Companions
keywords western plaguelands, recipes, patterns, professions, companions
coords live
version 1

