step Professions with no Western Plaguelands source

  zone map 1423

  note First Aid and Fishing have no Western Plaguelands source in the data: no in-zone vendor sells either profession's recipes, and no in-zone mob drops them as zone-exclusive or narrow stock. Polestar's own profession guides cover those progressions.

